{"pr": 41977, "type": "features", "branch": "9.2.x", "title": "Add thumbnail fitment functionality", "url": "https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/pull/41977", "issue": 26158, "issue_title": "Add ability to set image thumbnail fitment", "issue_body": "#### Is your feature request related to a problem?\r\n\r\nI want to implement a fancybox gallery to my client's templates, which will show a large image that can go full screen. I cannot set how an image should fit into the generated thumbnail dimensions.\r\n\r\n#### Describe the solution you'd like\r\n\r\nWe should be able to configure how each thumbnail size should be generated and add a new configuration option for this.\r\n- Fit the thumbnail - current behavior\r\n- Fill the thumbnail (and crop if needed) - new behavior. Could be useful for product image thumbnails for example on some themes.\r\n- Keep original dimensions and respect the longest side of image - new behavior. Useful for fullscreen product galleries with photoswipe or fancybox for example. Do not upscale the image and create whitespace in this case - max thumbnail dimensions serve as a \"limiters\", not precise dimensions.\r\n\r\n#### FAQ\r\n- No BC breaks\r\n- Only applied if user wants to or theme is setup like this\r\n\r\n#### Graphical explanation\r\n![thumbnails](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/6097524/205951082-4ab0ae71-f2c9-489a-bc8b-534a2bd93ff0.png)\r\n\r\n#### UX\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/43613217/207018425-ee72186e-5aca-4af1-941a-fb6136444bdf.png)\r\n#### Usage example - product page gallery\r\nCurrently, the client would get shown a square image with white unneded content on top and bottom, instead of a nice full screen image.\r\n\r\n![Výstřižek](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/6097524/136533126-5c477514-4293-4e65-b483-629cacd687d6.JPG)\r\n", "base_commit": "454a11d95c9c0e027d3d9ae05d5c7de5a92eaba3", "merge_commit": "eee631e37219267f21b29b56e582b68e1035b9d8", "files": ["classes/ImageManager.php", "classes/ImageType.php", "classes/webservice/WebserviceSpecificManagementImages.php", "controllers/admin/AdminStoresController.php", "install-dev/data/db_structure.sql", "install-dev/fixtures/fashion/img/c/resize.php", "install-dev/fixtures/fashion/img/p/resize.php", "src/Adapter/Image/ImageGenerator.php", "src/Adapter/Image/ImageRetriever.php", "src/Adapter/Image/Uploader/AbstractImageUploader.php", "src/Adapter/Image/Uploader/CategoryCoverImageUploader.php", "src/Adapter/Image/Uploader/CategoryThumbnailImageUploader.php", "src/Adapter/Image/Uploader/ManufacturerImageUploader.php", "src/Adapter/ImageThumbnailsRegenerator.php", "src/Adapter/Import/ImageCopier.php", "src/Adapter/Product/Image/Repository/ProductImageRepository.php", "src/Core/Domain/ImageSettings/Command/AddImageTypeCommand.php", "src/Core/Domain/ImageSettings/Command/EditImageSettingsCommand.php", "src/Core/Domain/ImageSettings/Command/EditImageTypeCommand.php", "src/Core/Domain/ImageSettings/CommandHandler/AddImageTypeHandler.php", "src/Core/Domain/ImageSettings/CommandHandler/EditImageTypeHandler.php", "src/Core/Domain/ImageSettings/Exception/InvalidImageFitmentException.php", "src/Core/Domain/ImageSettings/QueryHandler/GetImageTypeForEditingHandler.php", "src/Core/Domain/ImageSettings/QueryResult/EditableImageType.php", "src/Core/Domain/ImageSettings/ValueObject/ImageFitment.php", "src/Core/Form/IdentifiableObject/DataHandler/ImageTypeFormDataHandler.php", "src/Core/Form/IdentifiableObject/DataProvider/ImageTypeFormDataProvider.php", "src/Core/Grid/Data/Factory/ImageTypeGridDataFactory.php", "src/Core/Grid/Definition/Factory/ImageTypeGridDefinitionFactory.php", "src/Core/Grid/Query/ImageTypeQueryBuilder.php", "src/Core/Image/ImageTypeRepository.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Entity/ImageType.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Form/Admin/Improve/Design/ImageSettings/ImageTypeType.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Install/Install.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Install/XmlLoader.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Resources/config/services/core/grid/grid_data_factory.yml", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Resources/config/services/core/grid/grid_factory.yml", "tests/Integration/Behaviour/Features/Context/Domain/ImageSettings/ImageTypeContext.php", "tests/Unit/Core/Domain/ImageSettings/Command/ImageTypeCommandTest.php", "tests/Unit/Core/Domain/ImageSettings/QueryResult/EditableImageTypeTest.php", "tests/Unit/Core/Domain/ImageSettings/ValueObject/ImageFitmentTest.php"], "lines": 805, "labels": ["QA ✔️", "develop", "Feature", "Key feature", "Needs documentation", "PR Autoupgrade opened ✔️"]}
